        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "The per-debounce `didChange` during continuous typing is the intended \"rate limiting\" of #16881. \r\n\r\nIf the goal is fewer refreshes while typing, how about: send immediately after idle (as done already), but during a batch, restart a full `debounce` timer on each change. Plus a maximum wait (e.g. `4 * debounce` since last `didChange`), so that continuous typing still sends periodically.",
